WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.710
Put the feeling roots to work today.

00:00:02.710 --> 00:00:04.420
Then the spelling words:

00:00:04.420 --> 00:00:09.950
when a vowel is too quiet to hear, say a related word where that beat is strong.

00:00:09.950 --> 00:00:11.550
The vowel comes back.

00:00:11.550 --> 00:00:14.210
The council fire game uses the same trick.
